  "question": {
    "text": "In the figure given below, for an angle of incidence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math> at the top surface, what is the minimum refractive index needed for total internal reflection at the vertical face?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/650025_soludad_1.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 147px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "jPO1E",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "3vBAm",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MyLe5",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "0u9eG",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "At point <math><mi>A</mi></math> , by Snell's law<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-07-27_at_3.08.19_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 160px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> ... (i)<br /><br />At point <math><mi>B</mi></math> , total internal reflection with <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />From figure, <math><msub><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></math> .... (ii)<br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> .... (iii)<br /><br />Now, <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br />From equation (ii) and (iii), <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br />Squaring both sides and then solving, we get<br /><br /><math><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
    "image": null
  },
